*~

# Local Cloudflare deployment state
/.wrangler/

# StateM 运行：契约、进展与回执留在仓库，机器态（run 记录、runbook、活动指针）不进
/.statem/runs/
/.statem/active_run
/.statem/runbook.yaml

# Python probe caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Isolated Computer Use implementation run records
/.qa-statem/

